# Evidence from one run of tests/browser/run-live.sh against this host's live
# Cockpit: screenshots, console logs, and the JSON result files.
#
# Never committed, and the reason is not tidiness. A screenshot taken between
# "Reveal" and the countdown ending is a screenshot OF A PASSWORD, and the
# console log of a live session names this host's safes. The suite writes them
# 0600 for the same reason. Keep the directory (so the runner has somewhere to
# write) and ignore everything in it.
*
!.gitignore
